# GMKtec rclone

This is a personal, non-commercial application used to connect a privately operated Linux home server to Google Drive using rclone.

The application uses Google OAuth to authorise access to the owner's Google Drive files for personal file management, encrypted storage and media streaming.

The application is not offered as a public service and does not provide third-party access to Google Drive data.

For information about data handling, see the [Privacy Policy](privacy.md).
